        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI SIG409-610-630, Modern 2 Foot Satin Stainless Steel Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 24 Inch Contemporary Stainless Steel Door Handle has a beautiful and durable satin finish that makes it a great choice for high-traffic areas such as a front door pull or as a handle on an office building or store front. It can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted. This Modern 2 Foot Satin Stainless Steel Door Pull has a 1-1/4 inch diameter grip--the perfect size for almost any size door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-SIG409-610-specifications.gif?v=1704354746\" width=\"558\" height=\"210\" border=\"0\" alt=\"AHI SIG409-610 Contemporary Stainless Steel Door Pull Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available:  <a href=\"/products/14-inch-contemporary-stainless-steel-door-handle-ahi-sig409-355-630\"><b>14\" Door Pull</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/36-inch-contemporary-stainless-steel-door-handle-ahi-sig409-914-630\"><b>36\" Door Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/48-inch-long-contemporary-stainless-steel-door-handle-ahi-sig409-1220-630\"><b>48\" Long Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the AHI SIG409-610-630 Contemporary Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li> \r\n<li>Length: 24-1/8\" (610 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center: 22-3/4\" (578)</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/8\" (80 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Handle Diameter: 1-1/4\" (32 mm) Round</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-SIG409-610-specifications.pdf?v=1691093352\"><b>AHI SIG409-610 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "24 Inch Contemporary Stainless Steel Door Handle,",
                "description": "The 24 Inch Contemporary Stainless Steel Door Handle has a beautiful and durable satin finish that makes it a great choice for high-traffic areas such as a front door pull or as a handle on an office building or store front. It can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted. This Modern 2 Foot Satin Stainless Steel Door Pull has a 1-1/4 inch diameter grip--the perfect size for almost any size door.\r\n",
